msgid "zeta shell — the ZETA RAYS terminal.\n\n  zeta shell status                installed shells, default, sessions, history\n  zeta shell themes                available themes (all on a black background)\n  zeta shell theme NAME            change theme (zeta, amber, green, purple, red, contrast)\n  zeta shell accent RRGGBB|system  terminal accent color\n  zeta shell font \"NAME\" [SIZE]    terminal font\n  zeta shell transparency 0.70-1.00   background opacity\n  zeta shell reset                 back to the system colors and font\n  zeta shell default bash|zsh|fish|...  shell for new windows\n  zeta shell sessions              open sessions (including detached ones)\n  zeta shell resume [NAME]         resume a detached session in this window\n\nChanges apply to terminal windows opened from now on."
