msgid "Usage: zeta-view FILE…\nShows any file in the terminal, in the right way for its type:\n  text and code    colors (bat)            JSON/YAML/XML       formatted\n  CSV/TSV          table                   logs                colors, from the end\n  PDF              text of the PDF         images/audio/video  details and metadata\n  archives         list of contents        binaries            hex dump (hexyl)\nScroll with the arrow keys, \"/\" searches, \"q\" quits. The file is never modified."
